| \`metric\` | string | Yes | One of \`cosine\`, \`euclidean\`, or \`dotproduct\`. |
| \`replicas\` | integer | No | Number of read replicas across availability zones (default: 2). |
| \`max_vectors\` | integer | No | Hard ceiling limit for collection capacity. |",
